OnlineLookup -- Look up mathematical information online
*******************************************************

Description
===========

The purpose of this package is to collect helper functions that allow to query
web sites for mathematical information and format it into Macaulay2 output. At
present, it contains two such functions, *note oeis: oeis, and *note isc: isc,,
but more will be implemented in the future.

Author
======

  * Paul Zinn-Justin (see http://blogs.unimelb.edu.au/paul-zinn-justin/ )
    <pzinn@unimelb.edu.au>

Version
=======

This documentation describes version 0.7 of OnlineLookup, released March 23,
2022.

