Exports
=======

  * Functions and commands
      * *note isc: isc, -- ISC lookup
      * *note oeis: oeis, -- OEIS lookup
  * Methods
      * "isc(Constant)" -- see *note isc: isc, -- ISC lookup
      * "isc(Number)" -- see *note isc: isc, -- ISC lookup
      * "isc(RR)" -- see *note isc: isc, -- ISC lookup
      * "isc(String)" -- see *note isc: isc, -- ISC lookup
      * "oeis(String)" -- see *note oeis: oeis, -- OEIS lookup
      * "oeis(VisibleList)" -- see *note oeis: oeis, -- OEIS lookup

For the programmer
==================

The object *note OnlineLookup: Top, is a *note package: (Macaulay2Doc)Package,,
defined in OnlineLookup.m2, with auxiliary files in OnlineLookup/.

